  "description": "For the spoken word in a live room — a lectern gooseneck and a body-worn lav/headset. Both lean on a firmer gate and a high-pass for feedback margin, and restore the intelligibility these mics lose off-axis. Aimed at houses of worship, conference AV and stage announcers.",
